Zhang Xin 張歆, Regional Inspector of Fujian [courtesy name Boqi 伯起, a native of Hefei County 合肥縣, Luzhou Prefecture 廬州府, Zhili, and a National University Student];
Qu Shen 屈伸, Regional Inspector of Fujian [courtesy name Zhongshu 仲舒, a native of Linfen County 臨汾縣, Pingyang Prefecture 平陽府, Shanxi, and a National University Student];
Zhao Wen 趙文, Regional Inspector of Fujian [courtesy name Zhixue 志學, a native of Yangwu County 陽武縣, Kaifeng Prefecture 開封府, Henan, and a National University Student];
Liu Kai 劉愷, Regional Inspector of Fujian [courtesy name Yanhe 彦和, a native of Yizhou 沂州, Yanzhou Prefecture 兖州府, Shandong, and a National University Student];
